    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>み、見つかっただす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Oh, someone found me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見つかったって、
一応、ここ店なんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So what, you didn't wanna be found?
But isn't this place some kinda shop?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>み、店だすが……、
う、売り物はないだす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-It is, but... I d-don't
have anything to sell...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>売り物がないから、
こんなところにいたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You were here because you
don't have anything to sell?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>す、すまんこっただす……
お、おいどんが扱ってるのは……
お、音だけなんだすよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I'm so s-sorry...
A-All I know how to
work with is...s-sounds...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275404</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>音ってことは、
聞けるってことですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, you can help us
listen to certain sounds?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひ、ひーーー！
な、何も売ってなくて……
わ、悪いと思ってるだす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E-Eeeek! Y-You think
it's bad, d-don't you... That
I don't s-sell anything...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇよ、
さっきから、喋りがうざいだよ。
言いたい事サッサと伝えるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Ey, you. The way ya talk's been
gratin' on me for a while. Ya really
should just spit it out already.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえが言うのか、
この書き割り野郎が</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like you can talk, you
damn stage prop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんだとー！
この毛無しのハゲぼうずが！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What'd ya just call me, ya numbskull!?
Ya wouldn't know a stage prop even
if it dropped down and hit ya on the head!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>す、すまんこっただす……
お、おいどんのせいだす……
こ、これで許してほしいだす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-I'm really sorry... This is m-my
fault... I'll p-play this for you,
so p-please forgive me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>売り物が無くて、
音があるってのは、
こういう事だったんですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ohh, so when you said you don't
sell anything, but you can work with
sounds, this is what you meant.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひ、ひーーーー！！！
や、やっぱり怒ってるだすか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>E-Eeeeek! Y-You're
m-mad at me, aren't you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いやいや、
誰も怒ってないかラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, not at all. No
one's mad, really.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほ、ほんとだすか……
そ、それなら良かっただす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>R-Really...?
Th-That's good...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これって、
また聞かしてくれんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you can play
more like that, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は、はい～～～！
い、いつでもＯＫだす……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y-Yes~! A-Any
time you like...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃ、
また聞きに来ますね。
ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, we'll come and
listen again sometime.
Thank you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっき、エト助が、
誰も怒ってねぇつったが、
おらだけは別だかんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, Ethos just told ya
no one's mad, but
I'm the exception.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おらは、おめぇみたいなやつ
いらいらしてくるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>People like you get
right on my nerves.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだども、
おめぇのその音への気持ち
おらは好きだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, ya know, I really
liked the feelin' of that
music ya played for us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これからも、精進せぇ。
んだば、また来るだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So just devote yourself to that.
Do that, and I'll come back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ありがとうだす……
や、安っぽいタンスの人……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-Thank you...
T-Tatty closet man...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
